# Req 带上全部守卫，含只关于别的形参的路径条件（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0096）。原来只带与 have / end 有公共符号的守卫，
# if (c) p[i] = 0; 的调用方传 c = 0 也被报 DEFINITE。
#
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ReportSafe=true \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=summary -analyzer-config 'rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:DumpFilter=^Q$' \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/pguard/g.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK-DAG: [oobsum:summary] {{.*}}"guard":["p2 <= 5","p2 >= 5"]
CHECK-DAG: g.c:5:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:guard_false] Proven within bounds: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: g.c:6:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: g.c:8:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:guard_false] Proven within bounds: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: g.c:9:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: g.c:11:1: warning: [OOB-SAFE:guard_false] Proven within bounds: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes)
CHECK-DAG: g.c:14:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 11 of 'a' (4 bytes) is accessed
